gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "If you're a fascist, you're not welcome\p"
	.string "to play this game. It's against the rules.\n"
	.string "If you're reading this and thinking,\p"
	.string "“You just call everyone you disagree with\n"
	.string "a fascist,” then you're probably a\l"
	.string "fascist, or incapable of drawing\p"
	.string "inferences from context and\n"
	.string "acknowledging a dangerous political\l"
	.string "climate that causes the oppressed\p"
	.string "to be hyperbolic.\p"
	.string "Don't play this game.\p"
	.string "Heal yourself.\p"
	.string "Grow.\p"
	.string "Learn.\p"
	.string "Watch some Mr. Rogers' Neighborhood or\n"
	.string "something.\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "This hack was made for transfems,\n"
	.string "by a non-binary transfem lesbian.\p"
	.string "A lot of the changes were made with\n"
	.string "this as the primary viewpoint.\p"
	.string "If you aren't a transfem, you're\n"
	.string "absolutely welcome to play, and I hope\l"
	.string "you do and enjoy yourself!\p"
	.string "Just please understand that this is\n"
	.string "primarily a labor of love for myself\p"
	.string "and my transfem sisters.\n"
	.string "I love you all. {EMOJI_HEART}\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "In this hack, both the player\l"
	.string "and the rival are over 21.\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "Hi! Sorry to keep you waiting on\p"
	.string "Kaya's preamble!\n"
	.string "Welcome to the POKéMON!\p"
	.string "My name is BIRCH.\p"
	.string "But everyone calls me the POKéMON.\l"
	.string "\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "By the way, this version uses\n"
	.string "subtle differences between encounter\p"
	.string "tiles to show which areas contain\n"
	.string "new POKéMON. Pay very close attention\p"
	.string "to where you're searching!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "Anyways,\n"
	.string "this is what we call a “Threenis.” \p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "This world is widely inhabited by\n"
	.string "creatures known as POKéMON.\p"
	.string "We humans live alongside POKéMON,\n"
	.string "at times as friendly playmates, and\l"
	.string "at times as cooperative workmates.\p"
	.string "And sometimes, we band together\n"
	.string "and battle others like us.\p"
	.string "But despite our intimacy, we don't\n"
	.string "know everything about POKéMON.\p"
	.string "In fact, there are many, many\n"
	.string "secrets surrounding POKéMON.\p"
	.string "To unravel POKéMON mysteries,\n"
	.string "I've been undertaking resnearch.\l"
	.string "That's what I do.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And you are?$"

